<title>JAPAN: Pioneer Electronic -2qtr group results.</title>
<headline>Pioneer Electronic -2qtr group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		136.23		vs	  126.05</p>
<p> Operating     loss 2.31		vs     loss 5.64</p>
<p> Pretax	 loss 10.79		vs     loss 3.92</p>
<p> Net	     loss 4.51		vs     loss 2.44</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 25.13 yen	  vs    loss 13.59 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Pioneer Electronic Corp specialises in audio equipment. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
</text>
